      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764613807266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, I need to start a return. Order number is VF5512-9A. Just tell me if I can do it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 20268,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764613813466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Certainly. Let me just pull up that order, VF5512-9A. I see it's for the VeloFit Aero jersey. Is that the correct item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764613819333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, the jersey. It's the wrong size.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 20268,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764613827466665
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can definitely look into that for you. So I can process this correctly, is it a technical fault with the jersey or a preference issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764613830133331
    },
    {
      "text": "It's too tight. The fit is completely off in the shoulders. I need to exchange it for the next size up.",
